# marketing/instagram — keep SOURCE in git, keep generated MEDIA out.
#
# Everything here is regenerable: PNG/JPEG/MP4/WAV are produced by the
# render_*.py scripts and the feature-reels/_render engine. We version the
# code + copy (*.py, *.js, *.jsx, *.html, *.sql, *.md) and a handful of
# example renders so the repo carries visual reference without the ~84MB
# of binary output. See ASSETS.md for how to regenerate the full set.

# ── Generated media (ignored by default) ──
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.mp4
*.wav

# ── …but keep a representative example of each format ──
# Carousel (4:5, 1080x1350) — one full 4-slide set
!carousels/car01_0.png
!carousels/car01_1.png
!carousels/car01_2.png
!carousels/car01_3.png
# "Verse for when you're ___" cards (warm gold, 1080x1350)
!verse-for/vfw_anxious.png
!verse-for/vfw_at_peace.png
# Story (9:16, 1080x1920)
!stories/story_01.png
# Verse card (photo style)
!cards/IMG_4058.jpeg
# Feature reel (9:16, H.264) — smallest example of the video engine output
!feature-reels/seek_streak_reel.mp4

# ── Local-only ──
admin.html
